  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4df0014cb02a0cf4bbbc7addabd2224a, type: 3}
  m_Name: MainDialogue2NG++
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  lines:
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: 'Okay, I''m not sure what the fuck is going on, but the only way you could''ve
      that dash and sword are because of me! '
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: So that means we already met before!
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: ...
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: You've got nothing to say, really?
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: I don't know how this happened, but I guess it is possible...this forest
      does mysterious things.
  - speakerName: Pig
    text: Do me a favor and get me 15 mushrooms, ok? I need those for a potion.
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: Also, my name is Humberto.
  - speakerName: Humberto
    text: But I guess you already know that...
